p; 笠</span></span></div><div><span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／張翠硯<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/01/hootie.html\" target=\"_blank\">Hōo國家徛在，tī各族母語ê文藝成就內底</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">22</span></span></div><div><span><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">光景bóng uē</span></h3><div><span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">趙善權<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/02/blog-post_2.html\" target=\"_blank\">歡迎來國定古蹟台南地方法院參觀</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">24</span></span></div><div><span><br /></span></div><div><span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張廷鋐<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/02/blog-post_14.html\" target=\"_blank\">秋田竿燈祭</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">27</span></span></div><div><span><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">逐家來phò-tāu</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">沈琬婷<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/02/e-kamihdj.html\" target=\"_blank\">曲盤頂ê騎士</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/02/e-kamihdj.html\" target=\"_blank\">——用台語kā阿公講啥mi̍h是DJ？</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">28</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span><br /></span><span>生活ê藝術</span></span></h3><div><span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">邱順和<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/02/blog-post_1.html\" target=\"_blank\">人生</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">30</span></span></div><div><span><br /></span></div><div><span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張寶明<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/02/e_3.html\" target=\"_blank\">喙利ê貴人</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">31</span></span></div><div><span><br /></span></div><div><span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">戴瑞民<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2023/02/kap-lim.html\" target=\"_blank\">武漢肺炎kap lim茶</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">33</span></span></div><div><span><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">台灣人寫真</span></h3><div><span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">水&nbsp; &nbsp; 晶<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/02/kaptshiae.html\" target=\"_blank\">Kap疫情tshia拚ê日子</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">35</span></span></div><div><span><br /></span></div><div><span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳昭蓉<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/02/tue-siau.html\" target=\"_blank\">留tū粿葉樹跤ê siàu念</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">37</span></span></div><div><span><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lîm Tiong Gē<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/02/pian-sit-thng-e-hoe-ek.html\" target=\"_blank\">Pián-si̍t-thng ê Hôe-ek</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/02/pian-sit-thng-e-hoe-ek.html\" target=\"_blank\">扁食湯ê回憶</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">39</span></div><div><span><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">讀冊開講</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">A-Koan<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/02/hiong-su-po-ki-thok-chia-cheng-hau-kun.html\" target=\"_blank\">«Hiong-sú Pó͘ Kì» Tho̍k-chiá Chèng-hāu-kûn</a></span></div><div><span style=\"fo